{"seq":2,"slug":"biosensing-diagnostics","title":"生物传感与诊断","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/synthetic-biology/applications/biosensing-diagnostics","wordCount":1445,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"生物传感与诊断\">生物传感与诊断</h1><p>活细胞是天生的传感器:它无时无刻不在感知环境——营养、毒素、温度、信号分子——并据此调整行为。合成生物学的一大应用,就是「劫持」并重新编程这套天然的感知能力,造出能检测特定物质并给出可读输出的<strong>生物传感器</strong>。从田间检测重金属的工程菌,到几美元一张、室温就能跑的核酸诊断试纸,生物传感正在把检测从昂贵的中心实验室带到现场。本篇讲清楚生物传感器的三段式结构、无细胞系统如何让诊断走出实验室,以及 CRISPR 如何成为新一代核酸诊断的核心。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-感知-处理-报告三段式\">核心概念:感知-处理-报告三段式</h2><p>一个生物传感器在结构上总是三段:<strong>感知模块</strong>(sensor)结合或响应目标分子;<strong>处理模块</strong>(processor)对信号做计算、放大或阈值判断;<strong>报告模块</strong>(reporter)把结果转成人能读取的输出(颜色、荧光、发光)。这与 <a href=\"../circuits/switches-logic-gates\">基因开关与逻辑门</a> 中「启动子整合输入、下游基因输出」的结构一脉相承——传感器本质上是一条以「环境分子」为输入、以「可见信号」为输出的基因线路。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    AN[&quot;目标分子&lt;br/&gt;重金属/代谢物/病原核酸&quot;] --&gt; SENS[&quot;感知模块&lt;br/&gt;转录因子/核糖开关/CRISPR&quot;]&#10;    SENS --&gt; PROC[&quot;处理模块&lt;br/&gt;放大/阈值/逻辑判断&quot;]&#10;    PROC --&gt; REP[&quot;报告模块&lt;br/&gt;显色/荧光/发光&quot;]&#10;    REP --&gt; OUT[&quot;可读输出&lt;br/&gt;肉眼或仪器&quot;]\">graph TD\n    AN[\"目标分子&lt;br/&gt;重金属/代谢物/病原核酸\"] --&gt; SENS[\"感知模块&lt;br/&gt;转录因子/核糖开关/CRISPR\"]\n    SENS --&gt; PROC[\"处理模块&lt;br/&gt;放大/阈值/逻辑判断\"]\n    PROC --&gt; REP[\"报告模块&lt;br/&gt;显色/荧光/发光\"]\n    REP --&gt; OUT[\"可读输出&lt;br/&gt;肉眼或仪器\"]</pre><p>感知模块的实现方式多样:可以用一个被目标分子激活的转录因子,可以用直接结合小分子并改变构象的<strong>核糖开关</strong>(riboswitch),也可以用对核酸序列高度特异的 CRISPR。处理模块决定了传感器的「智能」程度——简单的只做线性响应,复杂的能做阈值化、多输入逻辑判断,甚至记忆「曾经检测到过」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"灵敏度与特异性-传感器的两难\">灵敏度与特异性:传感器的两难</h2><p>评价一个传感器,核心是两个常常互相拉扯的指标:<strong>灵敏度</strong>(能测到多低的浓度)和<strong>特异性</strong>(能否不被相似分子误导)。感知模块对目标的响应通常遵循 Hill 型曲线:</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>输出</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>O</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>O</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>O</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>A</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>K</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>n</mi></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>A</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{输出} = O_{\\min} + (O_{\\max}-O_{\\min}) \\cdot \\frac{[A]^n}{K_d^n + [A]^n}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">输出</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4143em;vertical-align:-0.9873em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6462em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3987em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0448em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3013em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5904em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9873em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是半响应浓度(决定灵敏度,越小越灵敏),<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 是陡峭度(决定阈值的清晰程度)。调节传感器,本质上就是调这两个参数:加放大级可降低有效 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 提升灵敏度,引入协同或逻辑判断可增大有效 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 让响应更像「数字开关」。下表对比几类感知模块的特点。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>感知模块</th>\n<th>检测对象</th>\n<th>灵敏度</th>\n<th>特异性</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>转录因子</td>\n<td>小分子/金属离子</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>环境/代谢监测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>核糖开关</td>\n<td>代谢物</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>通路内反馈</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>抗体/结合蛋白</td>\n<td>蛋白/大分子</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>免疫诊断</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CRISPR(Cas13/Cas12)</td>\n<td>核酸序列</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>病原核酸诊断</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>放大与逻辑处理常借助前面讲过的反馈原理——例如用 <a href=\"../circuits/oscillators-feedback\">振荡器与反馈线路</a> 里的正反馈做信号放大、用负反馈压噪声。这也是为什么传感器设计离不开 <a href=\"../circuits/debugging-orthogonality\">线路调试与正交性</a> 的串扰控制:误响应往往就是一种串扰。</p>\n<h2 id=\"无细胞系统-让诊断走出实验室\">无细胞系统:让诊断走出实验室</h2><p>把传感线路装进活细菌虽然强大,但要让它进入医院、海关、田间,活的工程菌带来监管和安全顾虑(见 <a href=\"biosafety-ethics\">生物安全与伦理</a>)。突破口是<strong>无细胞系统</strong>(cell-free system):把转录翻译所需的分子机器从细胞里提取出来、冻干到一张纸上,使用时滴加样本即可启动反应,既无活体逃逸风险,又能室温保存、现场即用。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    EXT[&quot;细胞提取物&lt;br/&gt;转录翻译机器&quot;] --&gt; FREEZE[&quot;冻干到纸基/试管&quot;]&#10;    FREEZE --&gt; STORE[&quot;室温长期保存&quot;]&#10;    STORE --&gt; SAMPLE[&quot;滴加样本启动&quot;]&#10;    SAMPLE --&gt; RXN[&quot;无细胞反应&lt;br/&gt;传感线路运行&quot;]&#10;    RXN --&gt; COLOR[&quot;显色/荧光读出&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    EXT[\"细胞提取物&lt;br/&gt;转录翻译机器\"] --&gt; FREEZE[\"冻干到纸基/试管\"]\n    FREEZE --&gt; STORE[\"室温长期保存\"]\n    STORE --&gt; SAMPLE[\"滴加样本启动\"]\n    SAMPLE --&gt; RXN[\"无细胞反应&lt;br/&gt;传感线路运行\"]\n    RXN --&gt; COLOR[\"显色/荧光读出\"]</pre><p>无细胞诊断最著名的案例之一,是基于<strong>toehold 开关</strong>(toehold switch)的纸基检测——一种由 RNA 二级结构控制翻译的传感器,曾被工程化用于现场检测病毒核酸,成本极低、无需冷链。无细胞系统因此成为把实验室级灵敏度送到资源匮乏地区的关键载体。</p>\n<h2 id=\"crispr-诊断-核酸检测的新范式\">CRISPR 诊断:核酸检测的新范式</h2><p>2017 年起,一类利用 CRISPR「附带切割」(collateral cleavage)活性的诊断技术彻底改变了核酸检测。其原理是:某些 Cas 酶(如 Cas13、Cas12)一旦被向导 RNA 引导识别到目标核酸,就会被「激活」并开始无差别切割周围的报告探针,从而把「一次识别」放大成「大量切割」,产生强烈的可读信号。代表方法 SHERLOCK(基于 Cas13)和 DETECTR(基于 Cas12)能达到单分子级灵敏度。</p>\n<p>CRISPR 诊断把 <a href=\"../enabling-tech/crispr-editing\">基因编辑 CRISPR</a> 的可编程性发挥到了极致:换一段向导 RNA,就能检测一种新病原——这种「换软件不换硬件」的特性,使其在面对新发传染病时具备极快的适配速度。与无细胞冻干、纸基显色结合,CRISPR 诊断正在催生一类「几美元、十几分钟、肉眼读结果」的现场分子诊断,把过去需要 PCR 仪和专业实验室的检测装进口袋。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>生物传感器是<strong>感知-处理-报告</strong>三段式线路,本质是以「环境分子」为输入、「可见信号」为输出的基因线路。</li>\n<li>性能看<strong>灵敏度</strong>(<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>)与<strong>特异性</strong>的两难,可由 Hill 响应曲线刻画,靠放大与逻辑处理调节。</li>\n<li><strong>无细胞系统</strong>把转录翻译机器冻干上纸,无活体逃逸风险、室温即用,是诊断走出实验室的关键(如 toehold 纸基检测)。</li>\n<li><strong>CRISPR 诊断</strong>(SHERLOCK/DETECTR)利用 Cas13/Cas12 的附带切割放大信号,达单分子灵敏度,换向导 RNA 即可检测新病原。</li>\n<li>三者结合催生「几美元、十几分钟、肉眼可读」的现场分子诊断。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"生物传感与诊断","id":"生物传感与诊断"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念:感知-处理-报告三段式","id":"核心概念-感知-处理-报告三段式"},{"level":2,"text":"灵敏度与特异性:传感器的两难","id":"灵敏度与特异性-传感器的两难"},{"level":2,"text":"无细胞系统:让诊断走出实验室","id":"无细胞系统-让诊断走出实验室"},{"level":2,"text":"CRISPR 诊断:核酸检测的新范式","id":"crispr-诊断-核酸检测的新范式"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"代谢工程与生物制造","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/synthetic-biology/applications/metabolic-engineering"},"next":{"title":"生物安全与伦理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/synthetic-biology/applications/biosafety-ethics"}}